ET as theorem-card evidence only; WEAPON-UCB-OPTIMISM is inspiration only. Status is leanCompiled, root imported, focused and Tests.Basic builds pass, the definition/supporting theorem/final theorem are checked externally, the final theorem has a full application canary, both axiom audits are baseline-only, and independent review found no P0-P2 after rebuilding all gates. Its fixed-model logarithmic expected-regret and expected-average consistency consumer compiles downstream. Failure policy: preserve t+1 successor indexing, same-measure a.e. transport, explicit Real RHS, and unchanged parent contracts. Do not shift to coordinate t, claim pointwise equality, or push through the reward-only measure. Anytime confidence and a complete UCB theorem remain separate.",
