idance only; theorem cards and weapon-only material are not proofs. Status is leanCompiled, root imported, focused-built, externally canaried through Tests.Basic, and consumed by the finite-arm practical pseudo-regret assembly leaf. Failure policy: closed-form threshold selection and end-to-end practical expected chosen-arm count are closed, and their positive-gap finite-arm summation now compiles downstream. Remaining work is threshold-sum simplification, an optional Real/Bochner wrapper, and production of the selected reward law from a concrete model. No anytime/self-normalized/general Freedman, cross-toolchain LML import, or final broad UCB theorem is claimed.",
