RATED-EXPLICIT-THRESHOLD-EXPECTED-PULLCOUNT, MLIB-FINSET-SUMS, MLIB-ORDER-ALGEBRA, and MLIB-MEASURE-INTEGRAL; theorem cards and weapon-only material are not proofs. Status is leanCompiled, root imported through the existing module import, focused-built, externally canaried through Tests.Basic, and consumed by the canonical reward-only trajMeasure endpoint. Failure policy: integer-threshold removal, reciprocal-gap simplification, positive-gap filtering, zero-gap elimination, and the complete practical selected-law ENNReal pseudo-regret theorem are closed. The canonical UCB selected-law producer and canonical reward-only trajMeasure theorem now compile downstream. An optional Real/Bochner wrapper remains separate. No anytime/self-normalized/general Freedman, literal cross-toolchain LML import, or final broad UCB theorem is claimed.",
